  projectName: Blind Faith
  description: 'Blind Faith is an atmospheric first-person horror puzzle game set
    in a technologically corrupted Victorian age. The player wakes up in a church
    which has been repurposed as a lab for all sorts of sinister experiments in the
    light, and they must manipulate the light to solve environmental puzzles and
    piece together what has transpired. '
